    "description": {
      "content": "The Speechmatics Automatic Speech Recognition REST API is used to submit ASR jobs and receive the results. The supported job type is transcription of audio files. Supports 55+ languages, speaker diarization, translation, summarization, sentiment analysis, topic detection, and custom vocabulary.\n\nContact Support:\n Email: support@speechmatics.com",
